      {
        "id": "cf02pr1_planetform_001_m",
        "name": "cf02pr1_planetform_001_m",
        "idsName": "655657",
        "affiliation": "co_ti_grp",
        "voice": "rvp101",
        "rumors": [
          "Die meisten unserer Vorräte wie Lebensmittel, Sauerstoff, Pharmazeutika und H-Treibstoff beziehen wir aus Los Angeles. Das ist keine weite Strecke, aber sie liegt abseits der Handelsrouten, und so dauert der Flug etwas länger. An diesen Ladungen sind die Rogues nicht allzu interessiert.",
          "Ich bringe Silber nach California Minor zum Besäen von Wolken, das noch mindestens ein paar Jahrzehnte laufen muss. Die Rogues warten geduldig auf diesen Silbertransport. Ich bin schon so oft überfallen worden, dass es mir inzwischen nichts mehr ausmacht.",
          "California Minor bezieht Terraforming-Gase und Wasser aus Magellan und Manchester. Hier ist alles Wasser so voll von giftigen gelösten Mineralsalzen, dass die Entsalzung zu teuer käme. Deshalb haben sie über Jahrhunderte hinweg so viele der Eisasteroiden dieses Systems abgebaut. Jetzt ist nur noch schmutziges Zeug von minderer Qualität übrig.",
          "Did you hear in the news that there was an attack in Zone 21 after all? First the Navy denied it, but now they confirmed that The Order has taken out a cruiser near the entrance passage to the Zone. It’s really scary how much damage an organization like The Order is able to inflict.",
          "Say whatever you want about its methods or politics, but the navy is an impressive organization. They have tracked down just about all of the survivors from Freeport 7. Last report was that a patrol tracked down a man named Brandon Rowlett. He tried to flee, but these navy pilots are among the very best here in Liberty. He never had a chance.",
          "There’s something strange going on in both the navy and the LSF. I’m hearing rumors about a bunch of people that are either reassigned or simply removed from their posts. It’s not like High Command to do things so under-handedly. It might have something to do with a traitor they’ve been trying to weed out lately.",
          "I can’t believe Rheinland has reached this far into California. Just what are they thinking? Certainly President Jacobi won’t stand for this, but the way the Senate is, it would take days for them to actually decide on any recourse.",
          "The navy has finally found the manifest of Freeport 7. It was pretty badly damaged, but we managed to retrieve most of the data. Finally, we’ll know who was on that station. We have a suspicion that someone on the inside had disabled the station’s defense systems. Our CO said that we are to round up anyone who was on Freeport 7. There’s a colony-wide search going on right now."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "cf02pr1_synth_001_m",
        "name": "cf02pr1_synth_001_m",
        "idsName": "655658",
        "affiliation": "co_ni_grp",
        "voice": "rvp111",
        "rumors": [
          "Wir importieren Dünger aus Houston und liefern Lebensmittel nach Denver, Manhattan und Houston. Synth Foods ist das Essen der Zukunft. Ich wünschte, die Bauern in Kusari und Rheinland würden das einsehen.",
          "Dies ist die Heimatbasis von Synth Foods. Wir produzieren hier immer noch eine ansehnliche Menge Lebensmittel, wenn auch nicht so billig wie Stuttgart. Den Anbau auf Los Angeles wollen wir allmählich einstellen. Der Boden und das Klima sind einfach nicht geeignet für die Dauerproduktion, die wir brauchen.",
          "Wir sind entschlossen, die Lebensmittelproduktion im ganzen Sirius-Sektor zu verbessern, sei es durch den vermehrten Einsatz von Biosphären in den unabhängigen und Grenzwelten oder durch die Einführung wirtschaftlicherer Technologien in traditionellen Anbaugebieten wie Stuttgart und Kyushu. Und wir werden es schaffen.",
          "Did you hear in the news that there was an attack in Zone 21 after all? First the Navy denied it, but now they confirmed that The Order has taken out a cruiser near the entrance passage to the Zone. It’s really scary how much damage an organization like The Order is able to inflict.",
          "Say whatever you want about its methods or politics, but the navy is an impressive organization. They have tracked down just about all of the survivors from Freeport 7. Last report was that a patrol tracked down a man named Brandon Rowlett. He tried to flee, but these navy pilots are among the very best here in Liberty. He never had a chance.",
          "There’s something strange going on in both the navy and the LSF. I’m hearing rumors about a bunch of people that are either reassigned or simply removed from their posts. It’s not like High Command to do things so under-handedly. It might have something to do with a traitor they’ve been trying to weed out lately.",
          "I can’t believe Rheinland has reached this far into California. Just what are they thinking? Certainly President Jacobi won’t stand for this, but the way the Senate is, it would take days for them to actually decide on any recourse.",
          "The navy has finally found the manifest of Freeport 7. It was pretty badly damaged, but we managed to retrieve most of the data. Finally, we’ll know who was on that station. We have a suspicion that someone on the inside had disabled the station’s defense systems. Our CO said that we are to round up anyone who was on Freeport 7. There’s a colony-wide search going on right now."
        ]
      }
