      {
        "id": "li0107_lpolice_001_f",
        "name": "Liberty Police Inc.\nSgt. Heather Fields",
        "idsName": "220056",
        "affiliation": "li_p_grp",
        "voice": "rvp501",
        "rumors": [
          "Dies ist eher Marineraum als ein LPI-Patrouillengebiet. Wir schicken eine Patrouille die Handelsroute nach Fort Bush runter, aber zum Schutz gegen die Rogue-Angriffe aus dem Pittsburgh-Schuttfeld.",
          "Wenn wir keine Arbeitskräfte für unsere Konsumgüterfabriken bräuchten, würde ich alle Rogues umbringen. Ich habe es so satt, immer denselben Abschaum festzunehmen und Jahre später zu sehen, wie sie nach ihrer Entlassung wieder kriminell werden.",
          "Ich hänge wirklich nicht gern mit all diesen Marinetypen rum. Die sind so bierernst, da juckt es mich, sie auf- und abmarschieren zu lassen. Die brauchen ein paar Liberty-Biere, damit sie mal den steifen Kragen lockern.",
          "Have you heard the news about Schultzky? He was attacked right here in Liberty! No matter what the news tells you, I hear the LSF knows exactly who did it, but won't tell us. They probably also know who destroyed Freeport 7. I wonder what they’re trying to cover up.",
          "You know what I heard? The planetary defense grid around Manhattan was sabotaged. That’s how The Order managed to get through to Schultzky’s ship. It’s frightening what these people can pull off. They must have people helping them on the inside.",
          "I've never even heard of \"The Order\" before the whole Schultzky incident. I'm no expert but I find it difficult to believe that the LSF, who is supposed to be protecting our interests and who we already know has a deep intelligence channel, didn't know much about the attack. How could they not see this coming? Well at least they got the Rogues around Pittsburgh. That's something.",
          "You must be the guy King was talking about. He called in and said that you might show up here. I don’t really have a mission for you, but the Job Board has what you’re looking for. There should be plenty of assignments that should be interesting for you.",
          "The President apparently called Bonnerille and the LSF on the carpet for the whole Schultzky screw up. The Chancellor is furious, holding us responsible for Schultzky's death. There's a rumor floating around that Intelligence knew more about The Order than they are letting on."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "li0107_republican_001_m",
        "name": "Republican Shipping\n Hunter Vann",
        "idsName": "220057",
        "affiliation": "co_rs_grp",
        "voice": "rvp146",
        "rumors": [
          "Die Handelsrouten zwischen Rheinland und Liberty sind gefährlich. In Hudson greifen die Xenos unsere Transporte an, in Bering sind es die Unionisten.",
          "Die Republikanische Großspedition ist die wichtigste Spedition in Rheinland. Ohne die hohen Schulden, die Rheinland im Achtzigjährigen Krieg gemacht hat, wäre die RGS noch immer die einzige Spedition in Rheinland.",
          "Die Republikanische Großspedition bringt Triebwerkkomponenten vom Ring in Neu-Berlin. Der Ring ist Rheinlands Symbol industrieller Macht; viele rheinländische Handelswaren werden da produziert.",
          "Have you heard the news about Schultzky? He was attacked right here in Liberty! No matter what the news tells you, I hear the LSF knows exactly who did it, but won't tell us. They probably also know who destroyed Freeport 7. I wonder what they’re trying to cover up.",
          "You know what I heard? The planetary defense grid around Manhattan was sabotaged. That’s how The Order managed to get through to Schultzky’s ship. It’s frightening what these people can pull off. They must have people helping them on the inside.",
          "I've never even heard of \"The Order\" before the whole Schultzky incident. I'm no expert but I find it difficult to believe that the LSF, who is supposed to be protecting our interests and who we already know has a deep intelligence channel, didn't know much about the attack. How could they not see this coming? Well at least they got the Rogues around Pittsburgh. That's something.",
          "The President apparently called Bonnerille and the LSF on the carpet for the whole Schultzky screw up. The Chancellor is furious, holding us responsible for Schultzky's death. There's a rumor floating around that Intelligence knew more about The Order than they are letting on.",
          "Well, the first analysis of the Freeport 7 data has just been made available. From what I have heard so far, the station’s defense systems didn’t fire one shot at the attacking ships. Either the radar system of the station didn’t pick up the attackers, or someone on the inside disabled the defense systems. Could be that there was a traitor on board."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "li0107_universal_001_m",
        "name": "Universal Shipping\nRep. Samuel Saverance",
        "idsName": "220058",
        "affiliation": "co_ss_grp",
        "voice": "rvp101",
        "rumors": [
          "Universal bringt die Vorräte für diese Basis aus Manhattan: Lebensmittel, Wasser und Sauerstoff, wie auch die meisten anderen Stützpunkte in Liberty.",
          "Universal bringt dieser Basis Gold aus New London. Ich bin schon seit Jahren Pilot für diese Goldtour. Ich weiß noch, wie es war, als ich anfing. Seitdem habe ich so viel erlebt, dass es mir vorkommt wie in einem anderen Laben, als ich zum ersten Mal in meinen eigenen Frachter gestiegen bin.",
          "H-Treibstoff aus Fort Bush und Grundlegierungen aus Sugarland werden von Universal Shipping hergebracht. Die Grundlegierungen bleiben hier. Ich hole den H-Treibstoff in Fort Bush, lade ihn hier ab und fliege dann wieder nach Texas, wo alles von vorn losgeht.",
          "Have you heard the news about Schultzky? He was attacked right here in Liberty! No matter what the news tells you, I hear the LSF knows exactly who did it, but won't tell us. They probably also know who destroyed Freeport 7. I wonder what they’re trying to cover up.",
          "You know what I heard? The planetary defense grid around Manhattan was sabotaged. That’s how The Order managed to get through to Schultzky’s ship. It’s frightening what these people can pull off. They must have people helping them on the inside.",
          "I've never even heard of \"The Order\" before the whole Schultzky incident. I'm no expert but I find it difficult to believe that the LSF, who is supposed to be protecting our interests and who we already know has a deep intelligence channel, didn't know much about the attack. How could they not see this coming? Well at least they got the Rogues around Pittsburgh. That's something.",
          "The President apparently called Bonnerille and the LSF on the carpet for the whole Schultzky screw up. The Chancellor is furious, holding us responsible for Schultzky's death. There's a rumor floating around that Intelligence knew more about The Order than they are letting on.",
          "Well, the first analysis of the Freeport 7 data has just been made available. From what I have heard so far, the station’s defense systems didn’t fire one shot at the attacking ships. Either the radar system of the station didn’t pick up the attackers, or someone on the inside disabled the defense systems. Could be that there was a traitor on board."
        ]
      }
