        "headline": "Daumann Family Targeted in Raid",
        "text": "STUTTGART -- Two luxury-class transports headed to Baden-Baden with New Berlin’s social elite were attacked and destroyed Monday by half of a Red Hessian brigade. There were no survivors of the disaster. \"This was a planned strike,\" Federal Police Captain Roland Bals admitted to the press. The Daumann family members aboard one of the destroyed transports were presumed to be the primary target of the vicious attack."
